{
  "title": "Storage Gateway · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "온프레미스 환경과 AWS 스토리지를 연결하는 하이브리드 서비스다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Storage Gateway</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#comparison\">비교표</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#s3-file-gateway\">S3 File Gateway</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#local-cache-and-upload-buffer\">Local Cache and Upload Buffer</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#cached-volumes\">Cached Volumes</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#stored-volumes\">Stored Volumes</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#tape-gateway\">Tape Gateway</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#fsx-file-gateway\">FSx File Gateway</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#deployment-and-security\">Deployment and Security</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>스토리지</span><span>53 / 62</span></div><h1>Storage Gateway</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 7 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Storage Gateway는 On-premises의 File·Block·Tape 인터페이스를 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 저장 서비스와 연결한다. Local Cache 또는 Buffer를 두어 기존 애플리케이션의 저장 인터페이스를 유지하면서 Cloud Storage를 사용할 수 있다.</p><p>Gateway 유형은 서로 다른 저장 모델을 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#s3-file-gateway\">S3 File Gateway</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#cached-volumes\">Volume Gateway</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#tape-gateway\">Tape Gateway</a>와 기존 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#fsx-file-gateway\">FSx File Gateway</a>를 구분하고 Network 단절 때의 동작·Local Capacity·복구 절차를 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"File과 Block의 원본 위치\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>File과 Block의 원본 위치</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>S3 File Gateway</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>On-premises App</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a></small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Gateway Local Cache</strong><small>File Interface 제공</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> Object</strong><small>Cloud에 Object 저장</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Volume Gateway</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>On-premises App</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-netapp-ontap\">iSCSI</a></small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Cached / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#stored-volumes\">Stored Volumes</a></strong><small>Cloud 원본 또는 Local 원본</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Snapshot in AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span></strong><small>Backup·Restore 설계</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\"><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#tape-gateway\">Tape Gateway</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#tape-gateway\">VTL</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#fsx-file-gateway\">FSx File Gateway</a>는 신규 고객 제공이 중단된 별도 유형이다.</p></div></figure></section><section id=\"comparison\" class=\"wiki-section\"><h2>비교표</h2><div class=\"table-scroll\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"비교표\"><table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Type</th><th scope=\"col\">Interface</th><th scope=\"col\">Primary data model</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#s3-file-gateway\">S3 File Gateway</a></td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a></td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> Object + Local Cache</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#cached-volumes\">Cached Volumes</a></td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-netapp-ontap\">iSCSI</a></td><td>Cloud primary + Local Cache</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#stored-volumes\">Stored Volumes</a></td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-netapp-ontap\">iSCSI</a></td><td>Local primary + Cloud Snapshot</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#tape-gateway\">Tape Gateway</a></td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#tape-gateway\">VTL</a></td><td>Virtual Tape / Archive</td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#fsx-file-gateway\">FSx File Gateway</a></td><td><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a></td><td>기존 고객의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a> Local Cache</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"s3-file-gateway\"><h2>S3 <span class=\"full-name\">(Simple Storage Service)</span> File Gateway<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#s3-file-gateway\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">NFS</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a> File Share를 통해 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> Object를 읽고 쓴다. Local Cache가 자주 쓰는 File을 보관하고 변경을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>에 반영한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>에서 직접 변경한 Object의 Metadata Refresh 등 일관성·File Semantics 조건을 고려한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"local-cache-and-upload-buffer\"><h2>Local Cache and Upload Buffer<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#local-cache-and-upload-buffer\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Local Disk는 접근 지연과 Cloud 전송 사이의 Buffer 역할을 한다. 인터넷이 끊겨도 모든 미보관 File을 새로 읽을 수 있는 것은 아니다. Cache 적중률·업로드 지연·여유 공간을 모니터링한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cached-volumes\"><h2>Cached Volumes<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#cached-volumes\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-netapp-ontap\">iSCSI</a> Block Volume의 주 데이터는 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>에 두고 자주 쓰는 Block을 Local에 Cache한다. On-premises 전체 데이터 용량을 줄일 수 있다. Network 의존과 Snapshot 복원 과정을 고려해야 한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"stored-volumes\"><h2>Stored Volumes<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#stored-volumes\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>전체 주 데이터를 Local에 유지하고 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>에 비동기 Snapshot Backup을 만든다. Local 전체 데이터가 필요한 낮은 지연 요구에 적합하다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#cached-volumes\">Cached Volumes</a>와 데이터 원본 위치가 반대이며 Local Disk 용량이 필요하다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"tape-gateway\"><h2>Tape Gateway<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#tape-gateway\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#reference-3\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 3\">[3]</a></h2><p>기존 Backup Software에 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#tape-gateway\">Virtual Tape Library</a>를 제공한다. Virtual Tape를 사용·보관하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3classes/\">Glacier</a> 계열로 Archive하는 Workflow를 지원한다. Archive Tape 회수 지연을 복구 시간에 포함한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"fsx-file-gateway\"><h2>FSx File Gateway<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#fsx-file-gateway\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#reference-4\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 4\">[4]</a></h2><p>기존 고객에게 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-windows-file-server\">FSx for Windows File Server</a> 접근을 Local Cache와 연결하는 모델이다. 2024년 10월 28일부터 신규 고객에게 제공되지 않는다고 공지되었다. 신규 구축에서는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a> 직접 연결 등 현재 대안을 검토한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"deployment-and-security\"><h2>Deployment and Security<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#deployment-and-security\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#reference-5\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 5\">[5]</a></h2><p>지원 VM·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a>·Hardware Appliance 모델에서 Gateway를 배포한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a>·Network Endpoint와 HTTPS <span class=\"full-name\">(Hypertext Transfer Protocol Secure)</span>·File Protocol별 인증을 설정한다. Gateway 하나가 모든 Protocol을 동시에 제공한다고 가정하지 않는다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>기존 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#file-storage\">SMB</a> Backup App을 바꾸기 어렵고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>에 파일을 보관하려면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/#s3-file-gateway\">S3 File Gateway</a>를 비교한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/#fsx-for-netapp-ontap\">iSCSI</a> Block 또는 기존 Tape Backup 요구라면 해당 Gateway 유형을 선택한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>온프레미스 파일 인터페이스와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 자체의 객체 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span>를 구분한다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/filegateway/latest/files3/what-is-file-s3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">filegateway/latest/files3/what-is-file-s3.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/storagegateway/latest/vgw/WhatIsStorageGateway.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">storagegateway/latest/vgw/WhatIsStorageGateway.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-3\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/storagegateway/latest/tgw/WhatIsStorageGateway.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">storagegateway/latest/tgw/WhatIsStorageGateway.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-4\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/filegateway/latest/filefsxw/DocumentHistory.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">filegateway/latest/filefsxw/DocumentHistory.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-5\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/storagegateway/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">storagegateway/ ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q049/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q049\" data-question=\"Q049\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q049</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q049/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An on-premises application expects an SMB file share, while new files must be stored as objects in S3. Which service is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q049\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon Route 53</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q049\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An RDS read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q049\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 File Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q049\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EBS gp3</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">File Gateway</a>가 온프레미스 파일 인터페이스와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 객체 저장을 연결한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">Storage Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q086\" data-question=\"Q086\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,4\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q086</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q086/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An on-premises Windows file application must retain an SMB interface while storing data in AWS. Which TWO services are candidates?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q086\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon FSx for Windows File Server</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q086\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only Amazon EFS over NFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q086\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS snapshot as a file share</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q086\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only Route 53 Resolver</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q086\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 File Gateway</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, E</strong> · 관리형 Windows 파일 시스템에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 객체로 이어지는 하이브리드 파일 인터페이스에는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">File Gateway</a>가 맞는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/fsx/\">FSx</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/gateway/\">Storage Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q050\" data-question=\"Q050\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q050</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q050/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company repeatedly transfers data from an on-premises NAS to EFS and S3 over the network and synchronizes changes. Which service should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q050\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q050\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Snow Family only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q050\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q050\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS DataSync</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/#aws-datasync\">DataSync</a>는 온라인 데이터 전송·동기화를 자동화한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">DataSync / Snow Family</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q040\" data-question=\"Q040\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q040</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q040/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A web application stores image files by key and serves them over HTTP. Which service should it consider first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q040\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A single EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q040\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q040\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon S3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q040\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a>는 객체 저장과 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 접근에 적합하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q047\" data-question=\"Q047\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q047</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q047/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Linux EC2 instances in multiple AZs must share the same files through a POSIX/NFS interface. Which service should be considered?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q047\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q047\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Each instance&#x27;s local instance store</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q047\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Regional Amazon EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q047\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">One EBS volume directly attached across AZs</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a>형 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 마운트 대상을 통해 여러 Linux 자원에서 공유할 수 있다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/efs/\">EFS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/\">Object / File / Block</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/step/\">이전 용어 <b>Step Functions</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/\">다음 용어 <b>STS / SCP</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
